(4897920, 711468, 58691, '<td valign="top">The unique perspective in this image keeps the eye actively seeking a focal point - and in a very good way. The reflections in the glass adds a counter-motion to the wave-like movement of the grid. The image feels almost as though it is animated. The contrast between the blues and the browns define a spatial separation throughout the entire image.</td>', 'The unique perspective in this image keeps the eye actively seeking a focal point - and in a very good way. The reflections in the glass adds a counter-motion to the wave-like movement of the grid. The image feels almost as though it is animated. The contrast between the blues and the browns define a spatial separation throughout the entire image.', '2008-08-19 18:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4897933, 711503, 80912, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think I would have liked it better either w/ a sharper focus or w/ a sepia/b&amp;w treatment. Perhaps even w/ a tighter potrait crop on the desk and board.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think I would have liked it better either w/ a sharper focus or w/ a sepia/b&w treatment. Perhaps even w/ a tighter potrait crop on the desk and board.', '2008-08-19 19:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
