(4900939, 710734, 56243, '<td valign="top">good idea.  However, i put together from the title and the key that the glass was really a glass of alcohol.  It looks kind of like a cologne bottle to me with the way the light hits it.  Otherwise very good.  You could bump the contrast up a bit more or use levels to have the skull look a bit less flat.</td>', 'good idea.  However, i put together from the title and the key that the glass was really a glass of alcohol.  It looks kind of like a cologne bottle to me with the way the light hits it.  Otherwise very good.  You could bump the contrast up a bit more or use levels to have the skull look a bit less flat.', '2008-08-20 18:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
