(4901273, 711462, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. :)</td>', 'Cute idea. :)', '2008-08-20 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4901281, 711444, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  How do you use a calculator to do a sudoku puzzle, since there''s no addition involved?  It also doesn''t help that right in the description, it points out this isn''t a math puzzle.  Numbers aren''t necessarily math.<br/> <br/>But all that aside, really, this just isn''t capturing my interest.  Maybe with more dramatic lighting and a lower angle, as opposed to straight on?</td>', 'Hmmm.  How do you use a calculator to do a sudoku puzzle, since there''s no addition involved?  It also doesn''t help that right in the description, it points out this isn''t a math puzzle.  Numbers aren''t necessarily math. But all that aside, really, this just isn''t capturing my interest.  Maybe with more dramatic lighting and a lower angle, as opposed to straight on?', '2008-08-20 21:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4901287, 711284, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, very good.  Squaring the circle.  I was wondering how to capture that myself.  I hope you tell us how you pulled it off!</td>', 'Ah, very good.  Squaring the circle.  I was wondering how to capture that myself.  I hope you tell us how you pulled it off!', '2008-08-20 21:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
