(4901883, 710860, 83650, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but my brain would have loved this even more had you continued the lines beyond and outside the frame.  Not sure if the jagged lines are the result from over sharpening or resizing.</td>', 'I like the idea, but my brain would have loved this even more had you continued the lines beyond and outside the frame.  Not sure if the jagged lines are the result from over sharpening or resizing.', '2008-08-21 02:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4901892, 711528, 83650, '<td valign="top">Looks very cool - like a painting I would see in an art gallery.  My only nit is that his left hand is directly behind the candle and is blown out on the wrist.  Maybe moving the camera back(or cropping wider) and spacing the candles a little further apart would have fixed that.  Still good enough for a 7.</td>', 'Looks very cool - like a painting I would see in an art gallery.  My only nit is that his left hand is directly behind the candle and is blown out on the wrist.  Maybe moving the camera back(or cropping wider) and spacing the candles a little further apart would have fixed that.  Still good enough for a 7.', '2008-08-21 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4901908, 710608, 83650, '<td valign="top">Mathematically speaking, I suppose you are trying to convey the reflected image(x2).  It''s just it doesn''t hit me as "math" even after looking at it for a while.</td>', 'Mathematically speaking, I suppose you are trying to convey the reflected image(x2).  It''s just it doesn''t hit me as "math" even after looking at it for a while.', '2008-08-21 02:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
