(4905463, 711524, 38478, '<td valign="top">I really like the motion blur of the person walking; nice photograph.</td>', 'I really like the motion blur of the person walking; nice photograph.', '2008-08-23 01:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4905763, 710860, 14867, '<td valign="top">Very good, nicely graphical.<br/>Could work even better with less white left and right.</td>', 'Very good, nicely graphical.Could work even better with less white left and right.', '2008-08-23 05:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4905764, 711498, 14867, '<td valign="top">The best amongst the shots with a poket calculator. Good composition, accurate DOF and excellent quality</td>', 'The best amongst the shots with a poket calculator. Good composition, accurate DOF and excellent quality', '2008-08-23 05:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4905767, 710891, 14867, '<td valign="top">Creative and funny shot / title.<br/>Unfortunately spoiled by a particularly flat light and a soft focus, rated above average for the idea though.</td>', 'Creative and funny shot / title.Unfortunately spoiled by a particularly flat light and a soft focus, rated above average for the idea though.', '2008-08-23 05:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4905832, 711118, 64670, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it, LOVE IT!</td>', 'Love it, love it, LOVE IT!', '2008-08-23 08:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4905833, 711336, 64670, '<td valign="top">Totally BRILLIANT!</td>', 'Totally BRILLIANT!', '2008-08-23 08:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906258, 710798, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. I love the idea and colors.</td>', 'Great abstract. I love the idea and colors.', '2008-08-23 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906263, 711528, 67697, '<td valign="top">This one is awesome.  The composed scene (with props and colortones) makes me feel like I''ve travelled back in time.  The floating balls are a great touch. lol the pi symbol looks like a smiley face from my perspective. Perfect photo for the challenge.  10</td>', 'This one is awesome.  The composed scene (with props and colortones) makes me feel like I''ve travelled back in time.  The floating balls are a great touch. lol the pi symbol looks like a smiley face from my perspective. Perfect photo for the challenge.  10', '2008-08-23 14:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906264, 711518, 67697, '<td valign="top">Here is one I hope ribbons.  I love the contrast of colors.  Nice use of the reflection too.  Very clever idea.  I think I need to go bake one now lol.</td>', 'Here is one I hope ribbons.  I love the contrast of colors.  Nice use of the reflection too.  Very clever idea.  I think I need to go bake one now lol.', '2008-08-23 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906266, 710947, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that I went to look this up.  I love what you created ehere.  Did you use floam? lol  This really does look like the diagram that I saw.  Is that the sky reflected in the marbles too?  Very cool.</td>', 'I have to admit that I went to look this up.  I love what you created ehere.  Did you use floam? lol  This really does look like the diagram that I saw.  Is that the sky reflected in the marbles too?  Very cool.', '2008-08-23 14:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906272, 710891, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2008-08-23 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906290, 710798, 90892, '<td valign="top">Oh no not another waterdrop (glycerin?) photo... more interesting than most I''ve seen.</td>', 'Oh no not another waterdrop (glycerin?) photo... more interesting than most I''ve seen.', '2008-08-23 14:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906350, 710798, 64568, '<td valign="top">My only 10 of the challenge, great vibrant colours</td>', 'My only 10 of the challenge, great vibrant colours', '2008-08-23 15:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906553, 711357, 30490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Still life!</td>', 'Beautiful Still life!', '2008-08-23 18:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906554, 711541, 97166, '<td valign="top">wow, what a great idea, and very nicely executed.  Maybe a little sharper on the front die, but otherwise, just wow.</td>', 'wow, what a great idea, and very nicely executed.  Maybe a little sharper on the front die, but otherwise, just wow.', '2008-08-23 18:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906555, 711500, 97166, '<td valign="top">the double reflection is actually pretty cool.</td>', 'the double reflection is actually pretty cool.', '2008-08-23 18:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906557, 711347, 97166, '<td valign="top">*snort*.  Those teeth are fantastic.</td>', '*snort*.  Those teeth are fantastic.', '2008-08-23 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906558, 711357, 97166, '<td valign="top">Your spot editing is showing up around the edges of the fruit here.</td>', 'Your spot editing is showing up around the edges of the fruit here.', '2008-08-23 18:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906560, 711518, 97166, '<td valign="top">*smacks forehead*.  <br/> <br/>For the photo, a 7.<br/> <br/>For the pun, a sharp rap on the head.</td>', '*smacks forehead*.   For the photo, a 7. For the pun, a sharp rap on the head.', '2008-08-23 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906564, 711486, 97166, '<td valign="top">more dice! However, the dice photos have been nicely pulled off. This is no exception.</td>', 'more dice! However, the dice photos have been nicely pulled off. This is no exception.', '2008-08-23 18:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906565, 711324, 97166, '<td valign="top">*blink*  woah.</td>', '*blink*  woah.', '2008-08-23 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906566, 710904, 30490, '<td valign="top">Oh yuck, sheep brain?  Good thing lunch was a while ago...<br/>Good color saturation on the garnish since your object lacks color at all. The image is very crisp and clear, but generally unappealing.  6 because of good execution and because of lack of appeal.</td>', 'Oh yuck, sheep brain?  Good thing lunch was a while ago...Good color saturation on the garnish since your object lacks color at all. The image is very crisp and clear, but generally unappealing.  6 because of good execution and because of lack of appeal.', '2008-08-23 18:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906567, 711210, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe..  It would have been the cherry on top if he had a fake mustache too!</td>', 'Hehehehe..  It would have been the cherry on top if he had a fake mustache too!', '2008-08-23 18:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906568, 711476, 97166, '<td valign="top">hahahahaha. <br/> <br/>I appreciate the humor.</td>', 'hahahahaha.  I appreciate the humor.', '2008-08-23 18:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906569, 710671, 30490, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if the lines were straight and not on some uneven surface, then we would have seen how the glass orb refracts the light and curves the lines.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if the lines were straight and not on some uneven surface, then we would have seen how the glass orb refracts the light and curves the lines.', '2008-08-23 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906570, 711240, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, just a little to blown out for my taste</td>', 'Good idea, just a little to blown out for my taste', '2008-08-23 18:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906571, 711109, 97166, '<td valign="top">Intriguing concept.  Voted a little lower because of lighting issues. Too much direct flash/light on the models.</td>', 'Intriguing concept.  Voted a little lower because of lighting issues. Too much direct flash/light on the models.', '2008-08-23 18:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906573, 711332, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love the blue hue</td>', 'Love the blue hue', '2008-08-23 18:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906574, 711498, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too blury for my taste</td>', 'Too blury for my taste', '2008-08-23 18:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906575, 710587, 97166, '<td valign="top">wheeeee...<br/> <br/>feels like a bit of a shoehorn though.</td>', 'wheeeee... feels like a bit of a shoehorn though.', '2008-08-23 18:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906576, 710958, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The satin is a wonderful touch.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The satin is a wonderful touch.', '2008-08-23 18:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906577, 711109, 30490, '<td valign="top">cute!  I wish the multiplication and equal signs were held a bit more level, but a cute idea for this challenge.</td>', 'cute!  I wish the multiplication and equal signs were held a bit more level, but a cute idea for this challenge.', '2008-08-23 18:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906579, 711121, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love those angles and lines!</td>', 'Love those angles and lines!', '2008-08-23 18:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906581, 711068, 30490, '<td valign="top">I burned my Thomas Finney Calculus book when I was finally through with it! Nice image.</td>', 'I burned my Thomas Finney Calculus book when I was finally through with it! Nice image.', '2008-08-23 18:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906586, 711118, 30490, '<td valign="top">Technically not mathematics, but physics, but an interesting image nevertheless.</td>', 'Technically not mathematics, but physics, but an interesting image nevertheless.', '2008-08-23 18:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906587, 711526, 30490, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness you have a slide rule??  I have heard about these things but never have I seen one!  Glad to have my electronic calculator in the 21st century!</td>', 'Oh my goodness you have a slide rule??  I have heard about these things but never have I seen one!  Glad to have my electronic calculator in the 21st century!', '2008-08-23 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906589, 711518, 30490, '<td valign="top">Very cute play on words and math!</td>', 'Very cute play on words and math!', '2008-08-23 18:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906590, 711116, 30490, '<td valign="top">Yes you might!  Is that just for the challenge of it all?</td>', 'Yes you might!  Is that just for the challenge of it all?', '2008-08-23 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906591, 710891, 30490, '<td valign="top">Cute and funny - oh and a nice image to boot!</td>', 'Cute and funny - oh and a nice image to boot!', '2008-08-23 18:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906593, 710444, 30490, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but in my opinion this image would have been better if the tower were square to the image, the off centeredness really throws it out of wack for me.</td>', 'I like the idea, but in my opinion this image would have been better if the tower were square to the image, the off centeredness really throws it out of wack for me.', '2008-08-23 18:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906595, 711472, 30490, '<td valign="top">A little too bright for my taste</td>', 'A little too bright for my taste', '2008-08-23 18:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906596, 710499, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love this one!  Nice job!</td>', 'Love this one!  Nice job!', '2008-08-23 18:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906597, 711341, 97166, '<td valign="top">dizzying, but not much substance otherwise.</td>', 'dizzying, but not much substance otherwise.', '2008-08-23 18:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906598, 710860, 97166, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it''s just a little too washed out for me.</td>', 'I like the concept, but it''s just a little too washed out for me.', '2008-08-23 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906599, 711085, 97166, '<td valign="top">lacking focus on the main subject.</td>', 'lacking focus on the main subject.', '2008-08-23 18:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906600, 711423, 97166, '<td valign="top">In an advanced editing challenge, you should really put some effort into cleaning up your backgrounds.  Of course, this effort should ideally made before you *shoot* the photo, but in this case, you can use cloning to get rid of all those dirt specks too.  As it is, it shows a lack of polish and care towards the finished product.</td>', 'In an advanced editing challenge, you should really put some effort into cleaning up your backgrounds.  Of course, this effort should ideally made before you *shoot* the photo, but in this case, you can use cloning to get rid of all those dirt specks too.  As it is, it shows a lack of polish and care towards the finished product.', '2008-08-23 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906602, 711528, 97166, '<td valign="top">A little heavy handed on the editing for my tastes.</td>', 'A little heavy handed on the editing for my tastes.', '2008-08-23 18:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906603, 711385, 30490, '<td valign="top">Cute pie plate, and cute idea</td>', 'Cute pie plate, and cute idea', '2008-08-23 18:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906604, 711441, 97166, '<td valign="top">This photo has a cyan cast to it that seems out of place.  Paying attention to white balance in the future can really help.</td>', 'This photo has a cyan cast to it that seems out of place.  Paying attention to white balance in the future can really help.', '2008-08-23 18:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906605, 710798, 97166, '<td valign="top">Not as cleanly executed as so many similar photos in the past.</td>', 'Not as cleanly executed as so many similar photos in the past.', '2008-08-23 18:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906606, 711535, 97166, '<td valign="top">*smacks forehead*<br/> <br/>What''s with the Pi puns?!</td>', '*smacks forehead* What''s with the Pi puns?!', '2008-08-23 18:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906607, 710947, 30490, '<td valign="top">This is just magical, love the image.  Not too sure about the correspondence to math, but I love it too much not to rate it highly.  Please tell us how you did it in the technical section.  I think you floated the little white balls in water, but you tell us what you did.</td>', 'This is just magical, love the image.  Not too sure about the correspondence to math, but I love it too much not to rate it highly.  Please tell us how you did it in the technical section.  I think you floated the little white balls in water, but you tell us what you did.', '2008-08-23 18:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906608, 710682, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love this one, it is one of my favorites in the challenge!</td>', 'Love this one, it is one of my favorites in the challenge!', '2008-08-23 18:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906611, 711480, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too blurry and out of focus for my taste</td>', 'Too blurry and out of focus for my taste', '2008-08-23 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906618, 711528, 30490, '<td valign="top">This one is too staged for me, the props don''t move the story forward and in fact don''t match the story at all.  Archimedes was Greek and none of this looks Greek to me.</td>', 'This one is too staged for me, the props don''t move the story forward and in fact don''t match the story at all.  Archimedes was Greek and none of this looks Greek to me.', '2008-08-23 18:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906672, 711240, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Not sure about the slight red cast.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Not sure about the slight red cast.', '2008-08-23 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906673, 711363, 76335, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch for the challenge. Compositionally, there are two competing subjects. I like the POV and urban feel of this. Maybe black and white?</td>', 'A bit of a stretch for the challenge. Compositionally, there are two competing subjects. I like the POV and urban feel of this. Maybe black and white?', '2008-08-23 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906674, 710904, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed, but yuck!</td>', 'Nicely photographed, but yuck!', '2008-08-23 20:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906678, 711476, 76335, '<td valign="top">Oh my...</td>', 'Oh my...', '2008-08-23 20:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906681, 710798, 76335, '<td valign="top">Cliche of course, and the focus seems soft. Nice try though.</td>', 'Cliche of course, and the focus seems soft. Nice try though.', '2008-08-23 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906683, 711347, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funny, but I''m not following the math. Not sure I''m supposed to.</td>', 'Funny, but I''m not following the math. Not sure I''m supposed to.', '2008-08-23 20:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906684, 711462, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fun composition. I like the desat.</td>', 'Fun composition. I like the desat.', '2008-08-23 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906685, 710671, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like what you were after, but the focus and lighting are way off. Nice try.</td>', 'I like what you were after, but the focus and lighting are way off. Nice try.', '2008-08-23 20:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906689, 711346, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well photographed. More of the background pattern should be visible; the area in the upper right is somewhat distracting without it.</td>', 'Well photographed. More of the background pattern should be visible; the area in the upper right is somewhat distracting without it.', '2008-08-23 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906693, 711545, 76335, '<td valign="top">The building is underexposed. Also, seems oversharpened, especially in the clouds near the horizon.</td>', 'The building is underexposed. Also, seems oversharpened, especially in the clouds near the horizon.', '2008-08-23 20:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906695, 711535, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funny. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Funny. I like the lighting.', '2008-08-23 20:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906696, 711535, 83785, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge, love it!</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge, love it!', '2008-08-23 20:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906699, 710444, 76335, '<td valign="top">The symmetry seems off to me, and the noisy sky is a bit distracting. I love the concept though.</td>', 'The symmetry seems off to me, and the noisy sky is a bit distracting. I love the concept though.', '2008-08-23 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906705, 711118, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s physics more than math. As far as the photo, it lacks clarity, and I think more contrast is needed -- I almost misssed the figure in the foreground (maybe I was supposed to).</td>', 'That''s physics more than math. As far as the photo, it lacks clarity, and I think more contrast is needed -- I almost misssed the figure in the foreground (maybe I was supposed to).', '2008-08-23 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906724, 711357, 76335, '<td valign="top">The only math is in the title. On its own, it''s just a still life. But a good one!</td>', 'The only math is in the title. On its own, it''s just a still life. But a good one!', '2008-08-23 20:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906745, 710947, 83785, '<td valign="top">Clever, what I consider one of the few ''mathematical'' pictures in this challenge.</td>', 'Clever, what I consider one of the few ''mathematical'' pictures in this challenge.', '2008-08-23 20:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906779, 711477, 74333, '<td valign="top">the color and clearness of this shot is breath taking</td>', 'the color and clearness of this shot is breath taking', '2008-08-23 21:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906809, 711511, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think the odds are one in two that your kid will suffer from the "Terrible Twos" -- if not the twos go by too quickly.</td>', 'I think the odds are one in two that your kid will suffer from the "Terrible Twos" -- if not the twos go by too quickly.', '2008-08-23 21:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906810, 711526, 1031, '<td valign="top">Yeah, sliderule -- I have one too. :-)</td>', 'Yeah, sliderule -- I have one too. :-)', '2008-08-23 21:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906812, 710984, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I know someone who does not want to go on this ride ... ;-)</td>', 'I think I know someone who does not want to go on this ride ... ;-)', '2008-08-23 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906817, 711385, 1031, '<td valign="top">Live your pi pan!</td>', 'Live your pi pan!', '2008-08-23 22:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906831, 711471, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent example/illustration of the concept of the bitmapped image being comprised of pixels.<br/> <br/>It might be interesting to select inside each of the squares and average the color values to see what it would look like if each square in the screen was really a single pixel.</td>', 'Excellent example/illustration of the concept of the bitmapped image being comprised of pixels. It might be interesting to select inside each of the squares and average the color values to see what it would look like if each square in the screen was really a single pixel.', '2008-08-23 22:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906834, 711423, 1031, '<td valign="top">I need a set of those ... :-)</td>', 'I need a set of those ... :-)', '2008-08-23 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906886, 711284, 67697, '<td valign="top">A great find.  I love how you captured the details in the floor too.  Look forward to seeing if you wrote anything about the scene here.</td>', 'A great find.  I love how you captured the details in the floor too.  Look forward to seeing if you wrote anything about the scene here.', '2008-08-23 23:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906893, 711541, 67697, '<td valign="top">I teach stats and did not even think about doing anything with probability - duh... lol.  Love the purple background and how you did a something there to indicate a sense of motion or rolling die.  The only thing I''d like to see different is that all of the die in the foreground be in focus.</td>', 'I teach stats and did not even think about doing anything with probability - duh... lol.  Love the purple background and how you did a something there to indicate a sense of motion or rolling die.  The only thing I''d like to see different is that all of the die in the foreground be in focus.', '2008-08-23 23:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906896, 710906, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the play on words and also that you made an "x" shape - all roads lead to algebra :D</td>', 'I like the play on words and also that you made an "x" shape - all roads lead to algebra :D', '2008-08-23 23:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4906901, 710726, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like this idea of showing the 3/4/5 triangle this way.  I also like how the light makes the sugar sparkle too.  About the extra highlighted space in the right corner - I don''t feel that it adds anything to the sugar creation.  I wonder if a different perspective would help eliminate it?  Cute idea - I may have to try this some time.</td>', 'I like this idea of showing the 3/4/5 triangle this way.  I also like how the light makes the sugar sparkle too.  About the extra highlighted space in the right corner - I don''t feel that it adds anything to the sugar creation.  I wonder if a different perspective would help eliminate it?  Cute idea - I may have to try this some time.', '2008-08-23 23:38:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4906909, 711085, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen photos where people relate Fibonacci numbers and spirals of seeds. So I am guessing this is where you are going with this? But I think at least the cone should have been in focus since that seems to be where your title is directing the viewer.</td>', 'I''ve seen photos where people relate Fibonacci numbers and spirals of seeds. So I am guessing this is where you are going with this? But I think at least the cone should have been in focus since that seems to be where your title is directing the viewer.', '2008-08-23 23:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907041, 711498, 93478, '<td valign="top">Super clean.  Awesome perspective.</td>', 'Super clean.  Awesome perspective.', '2008-08-24 00:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907046, 711486, 93478, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the wooden rods symbolize but they sure do add interesting form.  Curious to know how you got the one dice blurred while the others appear to be falling too.</td>', 'Not sure what the wooden rods symbolize but they sure do add interesting form.  Curious to know how you got the one dice blurred while the others appear to be falling too.', '2008-08-24 00:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907049, 711437, 93478, '<td valign="top">I like your take on the challenge.  Math''s all around us.  Good subject and the colors are brought out well.</td>', 'I like your take on the challenge.  Math''s all around us.  Good subject and the colors are brought out well.', '2008-08-24 00:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907053, 711545, 93478, '<td valign="top">I like your perspective on the challenge (and the building!).  Its a little too dark for me.  I wonder what it would look like with front lighting.  Overall good shot though.</td>', 'I like your perspective on the challenge (and the building!).  Its a little too dark for me.  I wonder what it would look like with front lighting.  Overall good shot though.', '2008-08-24 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907057, 711121, 93478, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s a lot of angles.  Nice contrast.</td>', 'Yep, that''s a lot of angles.  Nice contrast.', '2008-08-24 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907060, 711368, 93478, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect much from the thumbnail but seeing it now it mesmerizes me.  I''m imagining I''m in a dungeon or somewhere I need to get out of.</td>', 'I didn''t expect much from the thumbnail but seeing it now it mesmerizes me.  I''m imagining I''m in a dungeon or somewhere I need to get out of.', '2008-08-24 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
