(4908723, 711363, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love your description. I''d would not sniff any plugins or actions that Slippy gives you, however. This didn''t come up for me in voting though I would have likely 5''d it. Not sure. Maybe there is just a lot else going on in the frame that draws me away from the parallel stairs as the subject. There''s also a slight curvature to the upper level of the stairs that (for me) interferes with the impact of the straight lines.<br/> <br/>I think this was a tough challenge to shoot for. A lot of folks did like yourself and shot architecture to convey the math used, or the geometric shapes.</td>', 'I love your description. I''d would not sniff any plugins or actions that Slippy gives you, however. This didn''t come up for me in voting though I would have likely 5''d it. Not sure. Maybe there is just a lot else going on in the frame that draws me away from the parallel stairs as the subject. There''s also a slight curvature to the upper level of the stairs that (for me) interferes with the impact of the straight lines. I think this was a tough challenge to shoot for. A lot of folks did like yourself and shot architecture to convey the math used, or the geometric shapes.', '2008-08-25 01:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
