(4908747, 710671, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hey! Don''t talk about Paintshop Pro as if it is a third rate product! You can get some killer results with it. I gave your entry a 5, BTW, but my previous comment explains it. A good idea and a worthy effort. Looking forward to seeing what else you do. (Just stay away from the aluminum foil!)</td>', 'Hey! Don''t talk about Paintshop Pro as if it is a third rate product! You can get some killer results with it. I gave your entry a 5, BTW, but my previous comment explains it. A good idea and a worthy effort. Looking forward to seeing what else you do. (Just stay away from the aluminum foil!)', '2008-08-25 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
