(4908775, 711085, 33352, '<td valign="top">Wow a ribbon, so the red went rusty who cares, great for a title Maths in a Cone.</td>', 'Wow a ribbon, so the red went rusty who cares, great for a title Maths in a Cone.', '2008-08-25 01:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4908784, 711471, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the pun, though to be honest, I probably would not have given this a high vote either. However, I''d be disappointed if I saw high wow factor, cliched DPC fare coming from you. You stay true to form in both your comments given and your own entries. Good going.</td>', 'I like the pun, though to be honest, I probably would not have given this a high vote either. However, I''d be disappointed if I saw high wow factor, cliched DPC fare coming from you. You stay true to form in both your comments given and your own entries. Good going.', '2008-08-25 01:54:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4908801, 711518, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent shot. You went to a lot of trouble to perfect this (carving the numbers into the apples, flawless composition) and it certainly paid off. Great work and big congrats on the blue, Nathan.</td>', 'Wow, excellent shot. You went to a lot of trouble to perfect this (carving the numbers into the apples, flawless composition) and it certainly paid off. Great work and big congrats on the blue, Nathan.', '2008-08-25 02:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4908805, 711284, 41357, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha - you can''t even thank the people who voted for your PB<br/>(cut out is not allowed to type anything on DPC for a month because of a black humor comment he left on one of the pictures)<br/>well that''s your fault - you should have known that this is a US site and in the US they appreciate humor just like in china  they appreciate freedom.<br/>well done.</td>', 'Ha Ha - you can''t even thank the people who voted for your PB(cut out is not allowed to type anything on DPC for a month because of a black humor comment he left on one of the pictures)well that''s your fault - you should have known that this is a US site and in the US they appreciate humor just like in china  they appreciate freedom.well done.', '2008-08-25 02:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4908813, 710499, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great creative idea and colours. The image has a beautiful simplicity. Huge congratulations on your first ribbon, I wish you many more.</td>', 'Great creative idea and colours. The image has a beautiful simplicity. Huge congratulations on your first ribbon, I wish you many more.', '2008-08-25 02:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4908814, 711461, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a pretty darn good take on the challenge.  Quite unique and in my mind fit the challenge well!  And it''s nice to be on the same page as you, too.</td>', 'I thought this was a pretty darn good take on the challenge.  Quite unique and in my mind fit the challenge well!  And it''s nice to be on the same page as you, too.', '2008-08-25 02:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
