(4908839, 710499, 68011, '<td valign="top">this should have won first place. by far the most original and overall great composition and shot. 10<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-25 01:18:22.</i></td>', 'this should have won first place. by far the most original and overall great composition and shot. 10', '2008-08-25 02:18:03.000000', '2008-08-25 02:18:22.000000', 0),
(4908840, 711336, 54566, '<td valign="top">I sit down many a times saying to myself "ok u dont have a subject , forget it"  ... then some fine morning i see u on the front page and again say to myself " look more , look through irene''s eyes". this photo is still not ''mathematics'' to me but all ur photos together are ''science'' of its own kind to me. u r half the inspiration why i buy a macro lens , u r half the reason why i pick up my camera again, u r the complete reason why my words fail here again ....</td>', 'I sit down many a times saying to myself "ok u dont have a subject , forget it"  ... then some fine morning i see u on the front page and again say to myself " look more , look through irene''s eyes". this photo is still not ''mathematics'' to me but all ur photos together are ''science'' of its own kind to me. u r half the inspiration why i buy a macro lens , u r half the reason why i pick up my camera again, u r the complete reason why my words fail here again ....', '2008-08-25 02:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
