(4909137, 711518, 66494, '<td valign="top">Congrats, just a sneaking suspicion on my part ... but fate was with you, I think the apples were going to work much better than the tiny pumpkins. <br/>Love it, was one of your 10s. Great average score here. <br/>Again, many congrats.</td>', 'Congrats, just a sneaking suspicion on my part ... but fate was with you, I think the apples were going to work much better than the tiny pumpkins. Love it, was one of your 10s. Great average score here. Again, many congrats.', '2008-08-25 05:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4909140, 711336, 66494, '<td valign="top">Irene, congrats. You are on quite the roll with ribbons lately, and in my humble opinion ... they are absolutely well deserved. Congrats, big time. Your eye (for the unusual and simple beauty) is unmatched. <br/>Love it, really do. And ... if you can take shots like this who needs to be a killer with the title? You are very good at letting the photo speak for itself.</td>', 'Irene, congrats. You are on quite the roll with ribbons lately, and in my humble opinion ... they are absolutely well deserved. Congrats, big time. Your eye (for the unusual and simple beauty) is unmatched. Love it, really do. And ... if you can take shots like this who needs to be a killer with the title? You are very good at letting the photo speak for itself.', '2008-08-25 05:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4909145, 710860, 66494, '<td valign="top">Great shot, congrats on your top 10. Very well deserved. Just for the record, the jagged lines do not bother me in the least. The simplicity of the shot and the lighting totally override that tiny issue IMO.</td>', 'Great shot, congrats on your top 10. Very well deserved. Just for the record, the jagged lines do not bother me in the least. The simplicity of the shot and the lighting totally override that tiny issue IMO.', '2008-08-25 05:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4909146, 711532, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s my personal favorite as far as variables go.  X is HUGE.  The signature powerhouse of variables.  Y can hang, but it''s not quite X (unless of course they solve to be equal).  And those a, b, c variables?  Mere shadows of the venerable X.  This was in my top five - and after I saw you had a good score, I went back to my top five and figured this one was yours.  Lovely work!</td>', 'It''s my personal favorite as far as variables go.  X is HUGE.  The signature powerhouse of variables.  Y can hang, but it''s not quite X (unless of course they solve to be equal).  And those a, b, c variables?  Mere shadows of the venerable X.  This was in my top five - and after I saw you had a good score, I went back to my top five and figured this one was yours.  Lovely work!', '2008-08-25 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4909147, 711530, 30982, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I thought this was an excellent take on the challenge.  Definitely in keeping with the subject but then taking it further, giving it context and weight.  And I like the processing - works for me!  Great job with this.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I thought this was an excellent take on the challenge.  Definitely in keeping with the subject but then taking it further, giving it context and weight.  And I like the processing - works for me!  Great job with this.', '2008-08-25 05:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4909149, 711324, 66494, '<td valign="top">Absolutely AWESOME. Great set up, great execution, great results. However, I still think this beauty was underrated. <br/>Congrats on your top 10.</td>', 'Absolutely AWESOME. Great set up, great execution, great results. However, I still think this beauty was underrated. Congrats on your top 10.', '2008-08-25 05:29:55.000000', NULL, 0),
