(4909167, 711109, 30982, '<td valign="top">What I meant to come back and add was how impressive this was for <strike>basic</strike> advanced - I can see this being a wonderful addition to a studio repetoire of shots for family shoots.  Much easier to do with multiple exposures in that case!  At first I wondered about the shirts, then figured that was post processing - very smart idea!  And it doesn''t hurt that your models are very enthusiastic ones.  Very well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-25 11:30:31.</i></td>', 'What I meant to come back and add was how impressive this was for basic advanced - I can see this being a wonderful addition to a studio repetoire of shots for family shoots.  Much easier to do with multiple exposures in that case!  At first I wondered about the shirts, then figured that was post processing - very smart idea!  And it doesn''t hurt that your models are very enthusiastic ones.  Very well done!', '2008-08-25 06:11:39.000000', '2008-08-25 12:30:31.000000', 0),
(4909171, 710499, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I''d never have come up with baby powder to show the light trace.  Congrats on the first ribbon - it won''t be your last!</td>', 'Very creative!  I''d never have come up with baby powder to show the light trace.  Congrats on the first ribbon - it won''t be your last!', '2008-08-25 06:17:09.000000', NULL, 0),
