(4909529, 711336, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Irene Fun Fact #3: Ribbon Hogtress</b> <br/> <br/>With this ribbon she has now won a staggering 30 ribbons! What is more frightening is she may be drowning in her own ribbons since she apparently can''t get to her the computer to check that she has won 7 ribbons when scoring 6.7 or less. Ribbon hogtress extraordinaire, only has one weakness and that is she thinks she never has a chance. That''s probably not a weakness but that''s the best I could find. :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-25 10:55:27.</i></td>', 'Irene Fun Fact #3: Ribbon Hogtress  With this ribbon she has now won a staggering 30 ribbons! What is more frightening is she may be drowning in her own ribbons since she apparently can''t get to her the computer to check that she has won 7 ribbons when scoring 6.7 or less. Ribbon hogtress extraordinaire, only has one weakness and that is she thinks she never has a chance. That''s probably not a weakness but that''s the best I could find. :P', '2008-08-25 11:51:52.000000', '2008-08-25 11:55:27.000000', 0),
