(4911743, 711551, 86322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i> Without the title, I''m not getting the math connection.  The title itself doesn''t mean much to me, either.  Purely as a photo, it strikes me as okay, but I think a vertical crop might work better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Math represents different things for different people, for me as a math teacher, this science is about balance, logic, several solutions for a problem. I decided to go with the balance route. On the other hand I did not want to go with the predictable way and show numbers and books. I''m sorry you did not feel the connection.</td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413: Without the title, I''m not getting the math connection.  The title itself doesn''t mean much to me, either.  Purely as a photo, it strikes me as okay, but I think a vertical crop might work better.   Math represents different things for different people, for me as a math teacher, this science is about balance, logic, several solutions for a problem. I decided to go with the balance route. On the other hand I did not want to go with the predictable way and show numbers and books. I''m sorry you did not feel the connection.', '2008-08-26 09:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
