(4912413, 711368, 3746, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent optical illusion!  I swore it was 9 chunks of tofu at first.  Now it looks like 9 panes in a window.  Good job matching the bgcolor of the site. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Now you mention it the optical illusion is quite weird.. if you stare at it long enough you can see it, then its hard to see how it really is again..</td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: Excellent optical illusion!  I swore it was 9 chunks of tofu at first.  Now it looks like 9 panes in a window.  Good job matching the bgcolor of the site.   Now you mention it the optical illusion is quite weird.. if you stare at it long enough you can see it, then its hard to see how it really is again..', '2008-08-26 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
