(4914098, 711336, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by crayon:</b></div><hr/><i> besides the title being a related to maths, dont really see anything mathematical on the photo itself. what did i miss here anyway? perhaps someone would PM me and tell me more, thank you!<br/> <br/>crayon<br/> <br/>p/s: congrats on the ribbon though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It''s been a (very ;-) long time since I went to school but I do remember that geometry is the mathematics of shape and space.</td>', 'Originally posted by crayon: besides the title being a related to maths, dont really see anything mathematical on the photo itself. what did i miss here anyway? perhaps someone would PM me and tell me more, thank you! crayon p/s: congrats on the ribbon though.  It''s been a (very ;-) long time since I went to school but I do remember that geometry is the mathematics of shape and space.', '2008-08-27 03:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
